      "writtenOn": "2024-02-28T17:37:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m still concerned about the case when the processing alters the amplitude of signals. In this case, the resulting cross-correlation will change even when there is no phase shift. I think, we need to normalize both signals before calculating the CC. Basically, for each signal, find the abs(max) of sample values, and divide them by it.",
